{"id":"po","lemma":"по","pos":"prep","rank":38,"glosses":["along, by","according to"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/af/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я знаю её по имени.","en":"I know her by name.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"her"},null,{"g":"named after )"}]},{"text":"Он назвал меня по имени.","en":"He called me by name.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to name, to specify","l":"назвать"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"named after )"}]},{"text":"По-моему, тебе нужна моя помощь.","en":"I think you need my help.","words":[null,{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"help, assistance, aid"}]},{"text":"Иди прямо по этой улице.","en":"Go straight along this street.","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"идти"},{"g":"straight"},null,null,null]},{"text":"Что бы ты сделал по-другому?","en":"What would you do differently?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"would"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},null,null]}]}